        <a href="/kawasaki-h2/dry-sump-kit" class="expertise-link">Dry Sump System →</a>
        <a href="/kawasaki-h2/gear-ratios" class="expertise-link">Gear Ratios →</a>
        <a href="/kawasaki-h2/mbe-9a9-ecu" class="expertise-link">MBE 9A9 ECU &amp; Map →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Discuss Your H2 Project</h2>
        <p>Tell us about the engine, the car and how you intend to use it. We will tell you honestly what the installation needs — and what it does not.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start the Conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

